                                                        BUSINESS QUESTION
Which products generate the highest number of support tickets?
Business value
Identify products creating the highest support cost.
                                                 
                                                          Query:
SELECT  
product,
COUNT(*)support_tickets
FROM customer_support
GROUP BY product
ORDER BY support_tickets;

                                          FINDINGS:
CloudSync Pro had 560 support ticket, which was the highest total number of support ticket gotten from all the products
